; form-knowledge-axioms-query-memory-observed.fk -- one durable local memory.
;
; This cell persists the answer-free route from the strengthened physical
; axioms rehearsal. It contains no evaluator answer and grants no heldout or
; learned-weight credit. Its evidence hash points to the raw local-model report
; named in the public receipt; current source identity is rebuilt on every
; read, so drift dissolves selection to nothing.
;
; witnessed: 2026-08-25 -> local query transfer 134217727, exact source artifact
; preludes: form-stdlib/form-knowledge-query-memory.fk
